+| 103 | 4C | What does "cross-department transfer" mean? | DECISION: assigning a ticket to staff whose `users.department_id` is NOT the ticket's `assigned_department_id` (including no department). It does NOT change `assigned_department_id` (no routing / department-change UI in Phase 4). Only Head / Maintenance Admin / System Administrator (`cross_department_transfer`), with a reason (`assign_note`) even for a first assignment. The ticket stays in its department; the new assignee sees it as assignee. CONFIRM WITH CLIENT: should a cross-department assignment also move the ticket to the new department? | `TicketWorkflow::isCrossDepartmentAssignment()`, `config/permissions.php` (`cross_department_transfer`) |
